# Cortex Freelancing - Direct Email Configuration
# =================================================

# 1. Primary Recipient Email
# Where all client inquiries will be delivered.
# Defaults to "hackathoncortex@gmail.com" if not set.
VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL=hackathoncortex@gmail.com
VITE_SITE_URL=https://cortex-blush-three.vercel.app

# 2. Email Provider Options:
# -------------------------
# Default: FormSubmit.co
# - Requires zero API keys or server setup.
# - IMPORTANT: FormSubmit requires ONE-TIME activation for new recipient emails.
#   On the first submission, FormSubmit sends an email to the recipient with an
#   "Activate Form" link. Click that link once to begin receiving emails.
#
# Alternative: Web3Forms
# - If you prefer Web3Forms, generate a free Access Key at https://web3forms.com
#   and set it below. When set, Cortex Freelancing will automatically route
#   inquiries through Web3Forms instead of FormSubmit.
# VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key-here
